      whyNow: "Three government cold chain policy instruments are active: PLI scheme for cold chain (₹912 Cr allocation), NABARD cold storage refinancing, and Smart City cold hub grants. FY26 is the last year to access PLI cold chain incentives before scheme closure. First-mover proprietary cold chain = 3-5 year competitive moat in Tier 2-3 cities.",
